WEBVTT

00:00:05.177 --> 00:00:08.689
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> At first living in the USA was quite difficult.

00:00:09.447 --> 00:00:13.282
We missed our friends and family and we didn’t like the food.

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:17.222
It was difficult to find fresh fruit and vegetables.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:19.635
We also needed to rent a car.

00:00:20.079 --> 00:00:27.115
In London, we don’t drive, but in Durham, not many people walk or use public transport!

00:00:28.235 --> 00:00:34.019
But we soon started to enjoy it. Our house was nice, and near a lovely park.

00:00:34.642 --> 00:00:39.842
Sacha liked his school, especially his music teacher, who played the trumpet!

00:00:40.409 --> 00:00:44.577
He worked hard and his teachers were very happy with him.